[{"client_msg_id":"537ec0ee-7e69-41f1-afee-6f5305482c99","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"期待","ts":"1636991360.165200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2zMJg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a633bb9-f796-43d2-9c56-1963e0dc1cfd","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"補完使ってない人もいるだろうしオプトインのオプションで用意する予定","ts":"1636989893.165000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b22"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18e5482c-de66-48f9-a3eb-09a4b54977bd","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"やっぱそうですよね、ありがとうございます。外部データでやろうと思います","ts":"1636989813.164400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"brKl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d08b1481-ba1a-47a5-857f-6cb4c92e61a2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"外出しかなぁ。ユーザー辞書は場合によっては別の処理系も読む。読むということは書くわけで、コメントに入れると消される可能性がある","ts":"1636989792.164000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iHZn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ed90623-7eee-4fac-9875-f80a1a6d2b68","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"んで、そのMRU的データを先頭に特殊なコメントとして埋めるか外出しするかで無限に迷っているという訳なのです、どちらも微妙に感じていて","ts":"1636989717.163300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TXpsj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88ecdf9b-8664-4db7-b8b3-85c16ec9193f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":ari:","ts":"1636989569.162400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T+Vu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d859260-e1d3-4a29-854a-0d27a2282bee","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(塊で処理されてるのは実装を間違った結果ではある)","ts":"1636989563.162300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8pLo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c853e2aa-42e3-4e38-8603-2c5a4e71f905","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ユーザー辞書の候補を分離することは可能だけど、これ頑張るよりは別にデータ用意した方がいいかなーに気持ちが傾いてます","ts":"1636989518.161800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VcDC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b6f3665-afad-49a6-b4c7-3dc89ddd0c05","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あ、でもユーザー辞書に複数入っていたら結局そうなるのか。あとは重複を許すとかかなぁ","ts":"1636989460.161000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cnE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0767ba14-9d7b-4112-8d99-f9fd86752ad7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あれ、塊で持ってくるしかないんです? 変換した候補だけをユーザー辞書に入れることはできない?","ts":"1636989424.160200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rEi/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a088a3cc-eb54-4d42-930d-e20fe8a6547d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"補完用データを別に持つとして辞書の中に埋め込むか別に用意するかどちらが嬉しいのかずっと悩んでる","ts":"1636988868.159000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mgyp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8ae9d8e-6696-4699-bd16-735d5d8ee22b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"グローバル辞書の候補を後ろにやるしかないか","ts":"1636988488.158500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ar5c8"}]}]
